# Saga of the Phoenix Knight (Q070) from cond 13, with the saga core: the fourth tablet takes
# the fourth amulet; Felix, the fourth NPC, sends the player after Halisha; a Shrine of
# Loyalty monster's death drops a Mark of Halisha through the core (the always-drop's roll,
# draw 0); an Archon of Halisha of the Four Sepulchers gives the fifth amulet and takes the
# marks; the fifth tablet takes the amulet; the sixth tablet calls the defender and its
# attacker, far away at their spots, and answers the same player that its fight is on. Expectations of the traced steps are the reference trace's; the rest are derived from the
# reference source (ThirdClassQuest.java, Q070_SagaOfThePhoenixKnight.java).
